				<wikidot:authorName>AgentWilson</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>802114</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I feel bad for upvoting this. I seriously do. The shark punching thing should have been a one-off joke, and it became a meme. Memes aren't funny out of context.</p> <p>However, this doesn't NEED context. It's pretty self contained and explains itself quite well without having to know the original short story. Part of me is like &quot;these jokes are overdone&quot;, but part of me is also like &quot;&#8230;but it stands on its own.&quot; And that's why I feel bad.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
