						 <blockquote> <p>Ok… I don't think I actually know the jokes this is based on, so the humour completely escapes me. One of those &quot;you had to be there&quot; things…</p> </blockquote> <p>The joke is that newbies keep misspelling &quot;SCP&quot; as &quot;SPC&quot;. At some point someone made a joke about the &quot;SPC&quot; being an actual thing. See if you can guess what the letters supposedly stand for, in context of this article.</p> <p>And don't go crazy with it either because this article is pretty much the pinnacle of playing the joke out. :P</p> 
