						 <p>I'm putting this out there so it can all be gotten out our systems at once:</p> <p><em>From the SPC file &quot;Groups of Interest:&quot;</em></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>The Beekeepers</strong>:</p> <p>The BeeKeepers a strange group that keep bees. We're not sure why, but we don't trust them. Yea, they SAY they do if for the honey, but seriously? They must be up to SOMETHING. They <span style="text-decoration: underline;">KEEP BEES</span>. It's just not natural!</p> </blockquote> <p>I keep hearing all the SPC things in voice of <a href="http://half-life.wikia.com/wiki/Cave_Johnson">Cave Johnson</a>.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
